The goal is to create the simplest version of the bomber game using html, css and Javascript 
It will use the same idea of the bomber game but simplified.
It will be a 2-player game with 2 bombers per player on a 6x6 board.
Start on an empty board. When a bomb explodes it makes the landed cell inaccessible to both players (blocks movement).
Each turn a player may move one bomber up to 3 orthogonal steps along an unobstructed path; blocked and occupied cells cannot be crossed. After moving, the player chooses one adjacent square around the moved bomber to drop a bomb. The bomb explodes immediately and only its cell becomes blocked. A player loses when neither bomber has a legal move.
Players alternate turns moving their bombers. A player loses when none of their bombers has any legal move.

Game rules notes: 
- the bomb block movement 

